# Claude Code creates a git worktree per background agent here. Each one is a
# checkout of this same repository (its `.git` is a `gitdir:` pointer into
# `.git/worktrees/`), so committing them would nest the repository inside
# itself, and they are removed when the agent finishes.
.claude/worktrees/
